{"name": "Mystery Box 5: Elements", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/13516a571af2b9ae6ee1c94ea543ed91.avif?t=1785740378\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/13516a571af2b9ae6ee1c94ea543ed91.avif?t=1785740378\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a new series of intricate boxes filled with alluring enigmas and brain-teasing challenges that will leave you a lasting impression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/8b43f1961eab11701d3ae6d660e8378a.avif?t=1785740378\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/8b43f1961eab11701d3ae6d660e8378a.avif?t=1785740378\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock all 10 boxes of the game and play this extra challenge in the room of the <strong>Elements Stone</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/634d10a556382b16e322e1c07345e45a.avif?t=1785740378\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/634d10a556382b16e322e1c07345e45a.avif?t=1785740378\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a straightforward user interface and captivating puzzles, this game promises an engaging experience that expertly balances challenge and entertainment, keeping you engaged for hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/7f54a79203ff0d509e5342b8f1bbf4f5.avif?t=1785740378\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/7f54a79203ff0d509e5342b8f1bbf4f5.avif?t=1785740378\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Box has its music theme, for you to play this adventure in a transcendental way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/694ee9d525a027c1a2765136902f8753.avif?t=1785740378\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/694ee9d525a027c1a2765136902f8753.avif?t=1785740378\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click the bulb button in the scene to get a hint that will help you solve the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In case you got really stuck on a puzzle, feel free to get in touch with the developer to get some more hints</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/63b2ad9177d4824f260a32d8a8c671f5.avif?t=1785740378\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/63b2ad9177d4824f260a32d8a8c671f5.avif?t=1785740378\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let your community and friends know what you're playing and how far you've gone in this escape room adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785740378\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785740378\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Test your mind in Mystery Box 5: Elements, an atmospheric point-and-click escape game. Crack complex elemental box puzzles, interact with tactile 3D contraptions, discover hidden clues, and unravel challenging logic riddles across 10 levels.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/e940474201f257bd6cc9c2866c06b75adce1af71/header.jpg?t=1785740378", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Strategy", "Software", "Point & Click", "Puzzle", "Incremental"], "developers": "XSGames", "publishers": "XSGames", "release_date": "Mar 27, 2024", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "2882350", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0Gdg_qpRvIg", "first_seen": 1746828000.0, "review_rank": 1680}